1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,425
Sarge... the Commissar's on our side. Right? Then why is he pointing that at ME?

2
00:00:07,075 --> 00:00:09,298
You looked at the exit, son.

3
00:00:09,748 --> 00:00:13,573
Fear me more than the enemy, Private. That is my entire job.

4
00:00:14,023 --> 00:00:21,164
Officio Prefectus. Every regiment gets one. He can shoot anyone who runs. Even officers.

5
00:00:21,234 --> 00:00:23,864
EVEN OFFICERS?!

6
00:00:23,934 --> 00:00:25,857
Especially officers.

7
00:00:26,557 --> 00:00:28,261
WAAAAAGH!

8
00:00:28,711 --> 00:00:31,428
Nobody runs. I am not asking.

9
00:00:31,498 --> 00:00:33,757
FOR THE EMPEROR! WITH ME!

10
00:00:34,207 --> 00:00:37,637
Rule two. He goes in first.

11
00:00:37,707 --> 00:00:39,338
...He's not scared at all?

12
00:00:39,408 --> 00:00:41,961
He's scared of what happens if we run.

13
00:00:42,411 --> 00:00:45,597
Good lad. I hate writing letters home.

14
00:00:45,667 --> 00:00:46,943
He IS on our side.

15
00:00:47,013 --> 00:00:49,505
Yes. That's why he'd have shot you.

